  "body": "Poetry `2.2.1_3` already bundled the fixed virtualenv `20.36.1`, but the CVE-2026-22702 record currently marks builds affected until `2.4.1_4`. Correct the Homebrew fixed boundary to `2.2.1_3` and protect the reviewed range during explicit history reconciliation.\n\nThe transition is documented in [homebrew-core commit 23e6231d5255](https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-core/commit/23e6231d5255200a5f4601d6c51ec9e260f51edd). Virtualenv's [20.36.1 release notes](https://virtualenv.pypa.io/en/latest/changelog.html#v20-36-1-2026-01-09) confirm the upstream fix; its existing `upstream_fixed_in` value remains correct.\n\nValidation: `bundle exec rake` passed 172 examples and RuboCop; `git diff --check` passed.\n",
  "changed_files": 2,
